# Testes HTTP do Capítulo 12 (use a extensão REST Client do VS Code)

### Registrar usuário
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@empresa.com", "senha": "senha123" }

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin@empresa.com&password=senha123

### Sem token (deve falhar com 401)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/me

### Com token (deve funcionar)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI
